#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:43 04d61a9d14d24f5e87277c86998721a5
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:44 b2f908df09b047f991de541ff8d79c45
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART3 RX input. It supports all "
"serial RC protocols except PPM and SBUS."
msgstr "RC 输入默认通过 USART3 RX 引脚配置。支持除 PPM 和 SBUS 之外的所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:46 6b28c23fbf6f4fc7b15c1858c48d4a5f
msgid ""
"Note: If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART3 TX "
"pin using an external bi-directional inverter, :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` "
"set to 3, and :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` must be set to 7 "
"(invert TX/RX, half duplex). For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX3 and"
" TX3 and set RSSI_TYPE also to 3."
msgstr ""
"注意：如果接收机为 FPort，接收机必须通过外部双向电平转换器连接到 USART3 TX 引脚，:ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>`"
" 设为3，:ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 必须设为7（反转 TX/RX，半双工）。对于 "
"CRSF/ELRS 等全双工协议，同时使用 RX3 和 TX3，并将 RSSI_TYPE 也设为3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:49 b5c9482aaffd44b38abbdb4954b9bcb3
msgid ""
"The SBUS pad uses a hardware inverter connected to USART2_RX. If you wish to"
" use SBUS then set :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` to something "
"other than \"23\" and set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to "
"\"23\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 焊盘使用连接到 USART2_RX 的硬件反相器。如果希望使用 SBUS，则将 "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` 设为非「23」值，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设为「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:52 a401b5e7c80d44f089b8c398b2c13836
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:53 0ea111ae6c9d415d8c1b6057ec3484bf
msgid ""
"Onboard OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) is supported by default. "
"Simultaneously, DisplayPort OSD is available on the HD VTX connector by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"默认支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的板载 OSD。同时，HD VTX 连接器上默认也提供 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:56 a517e49238e6449e90e9032310e4175f
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:57 db5dec330f6142e7a8138a5e5c18c3e8
msgid ""
"The SPEDIX F405 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 "
"to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus "
"M9 on a separate pad for LED strip (default configuration) or another PWM "
"output."
msgstr ""
"SPEDIX F405 最多支持9路 PWM 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M8 的焊盘在电机连接器和独立焊盘上均有提供，另有 M9 在独立焊盘上，默认用于"
" LED 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:61 690a58e47aad4f6897e0a70c9fa44af1
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为4个组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:63 951b14f80bd746a19e91cd218ecbdd28
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在组1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:64 bfa8861295ee4ba089ab72e6df756879
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 在组2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:65 7710f7c79d8c492399900519ae694c1b
msgid "PWM 7-8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 在组3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:66 c6c6d9347ef5413aaee1737e3cc8b8e5
msgid "PWM 9 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在组4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:68 48325de037e34ed19ee50b4217d1deaf
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。如果某组中的任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。通道1-4支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:73 83614cba3ab949ee9c7a75dbd15a6651
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:74 25cfefe4dfb1486b89fbdce2e758e6c2
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. "
"The voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries. The correct battery "
"setting parameters are:"
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器和外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器最高支持6S锂电池。正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:77 a0ae563d76644ea7bc6650d9e63d0c03
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:78 eff107ee17db488c8f26c25f379e2bb9
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:79 7b2b24dd3e454d029d8df9730fe96e76
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11 (CURR pin)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11（CURR 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:80 f61b4bc75c284cc39ad2b03a5b16369b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:81 6ffd7901ba4f45d7b9242456820b0fd2
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 50"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 50"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:84 0a111e74eff14b7eb1bde0d8ee6d5db0
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:85 3ca4940eee114e159a0b8508a467e7f8
msgid ""
"The board has no onboard compass. External compass modules can be connected "
"via the I2C bus (SDA/SCL)."
msgstr "该板无板载罗盘。可通过 I2C 总线（SDA/SCL）连接外部罗盘模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:88 fb9e7b9de3c643a78428256bcd4f2c10
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:89 d9ec7422356545b6a2a032729442c48f
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制相机输出到标记为「CAM1」和「CAM2」的连接器。将此 GPIO 设置为低电平可将视频输出从 CAM1 切换到 "
"CAM2。默认情况下，RELAY3 配置为控制此引脚，并将 GPIO 设置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:92 d8f45df0afc74a9db97311bffde9a04c
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:94 47c99d7f86ab4982b3e8a26defefe336
msgid ""
"Firmware for the SPEDIX F405 is available from `ArduPilot Firmware Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ under the ``SPEDIXF405`` target."
msgstr ""
"SPEDIX F405 的固件可从 `ArduPilot 固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ "
"获取，目标名称为 ``SPEDIXF405``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:97 8d741e0efc244b4da47f9c21f0ebdedc
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spedixf405.rst:99 9eaa4154df854549b2fcd19fa9f571e0
msgid ""
"To flash firmware initially, connect USB while holding the bootloader button"
" and use DFU to load the ``with_bl.hex`` file. Subsequent updates can be "
"applied using ``.apj`` files through a ground station."
msgstr ""
"首次烧录固件时，按住引导程序按钮同时插入 USB，然后使用 DFU 加载 ``with_bl.hex`` 文件。后续更新可通过地面站使用 "
"``.apj`` 文件进行。"
